        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we routinely investigate reputation management companies that offer these services and, if warranted, we take action against them, including by pursuing legal action to disrupt these harmful markets.",
        "start_character": 38035,
        "end_character": 38247
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have developed expertise in AI technologies through our use of natural language processing, large language models (“LLMs”) and neural network models across our business, from search results and review recommendations to ad delivery to content moderation.",
        "start_character": 4345,
        "end_character": 4615
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similarly, if our data suggests that a user is a homeowner, we might promote collections of businesses that offer spring cleaning or other seasonally appropriate services.",
        "start_character": 21731,
        "end_character": 21902
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similarly, we designed our Yelp for Business app to make it easier for businesses to engage with their customers and manage their presence on Yelp.",
        "start_character": 25243,
        "end_character": 25390
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To that end, we provide leadership development programs for new and continuing managers that focus on developing the self, developing others and driving business results.",
        "start_character": 65037,
        "end_character": 65207
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide Services businesses with the ability to provide competing quotes for consumers using our Request-a-Quote feature.",
        "start_character": 9688,
        "end_character": 9817
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a range of ad products designed for multi-location advertisers, including: Showcase Ads, which showcase and feature limited-time offers, new products or promotions in relevant search results;",
        "start_character": 9865,
        "end_character": 10065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in a rapidly evolving industry, and many laws and regulations that impact our business are being proposed, still evolving or being tested in courts.",
        "start_character": 50066,
        "end_character": 50225
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We rely on laws limiting the liability of providers of online services for activities of their users and other third parties, such as Section 230 of the Communications Decency Act (“CDA 230”) in the United States.",
        "start_character": 49218,
        "end_character": 49431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our advertising products directly through our sales force as well as online through our website and our Yelp for Business app, and indirectly through partners.",
        "start_character": 17559,
        "end_character": 17726
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain competitors could also use strong or dominant positions in one or more markets to gain competitive advantage against us in markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 47627,
        "end_character": 47786
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001345016-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001345016-26-000019-df9249ce912f2708",
        "accession_number": "0001345016-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to participating in virtual volunteer events in partnership with various nonprofit organizations, Yelp employees made a difference in 2025 through the Yelp Foundation (the “Foundation”), a non-profit organization established by our Board in 2011 that directly supports consumers and local businesses in the communities in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 60374,
        "end_character": 60725
      }
